#: desktopfilepage.cpp:78
msgid ""
"Be careful, Grantlee does not support '-' in variable name. So when you want "
"to add extra header as \"X-Original-To\" add \"X-Original-To\" in list, but "
"use \"XOriginalTo\" as variable in Grantlee (remove '-' in name)."
msgstr ""
"Budite oprezni, Grantlee ne podržava '-' u imenima varijabli. Stoga, kada "
"želite dodati zadlavje kao \"X-Original-To\" dodajte \"X-Original-To\" u "
"listu, ali koristite\"XOriginalTo\" kao varijablu u Grantlee (uklonite '-' u "
"imenu)."

